# Native continuation of the complete-opening path through Terri's Orion lead.
COMMAND restore
TYPE FORKFULL
KEY enter
ASSERT_LOCATION 127 d3
LABEL fork_restored
COMMAND north
COMMAND north
COMMAND east
COMMAND sit
COMMAND read memo
COMMAND wait until 22:00
COMMAND wait
LABEL terri_arrives
COMMAND ask terri about orion
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND wait
COMMAND read napkin
ASSERT_LOCATION 139 d3
LABEL napkin_received
COMMAND save
TYPE TERRIFULL
KEY enter
